[403113] = {403113, 10031, 14, 8, "0", "0", "I\u{0020}want\u{0020}to\u{0020}keep\u{0020}on\u{0020}pushing\u{0020}ahead\u{0020}like\u{0020}a\u{0020}waterwheel,\u{0020}though\u{0020}the\u{0020}rivers\u{0020}may\u{0020}one\u{0020}day\u{0020}dry\u{0020}up\u{0020}and\u{0020}fade...\u{0020}I\u{0020}know,\u{0020}it's\u{0020}kind\u{0020}of\u{0020}embarrassing\u{0020}to\u{0020}say,\u{0020}but\u{0020}let's\u{0020}give\u{0020}it\u{0020}our\u{0020}all,\u{0020}Navigator!", "0", "即使河流乾涸，我也想讓水車不斷轉動下去……雖然這麼說有點難為情，但領航，一起加油吧！", "0", "0", "0", "cv_aofeiliya_14", "0", "0"},
