[403126] = {403126, 10031, 28, 21, "0", "0", "I'd\u{0020}play\u{0020}in\u{0020}the\u{0020}mountains\u{0020}as\u{0020}a\u{0020}kid\u{0020}and\u{0020}get\u{0020}filthy.\u{0020}Then\u{0020}I'd\u{0020}go\u{0020}and\u{0020}wash\u{0020}in\u{0020}a\u{0020}stream\u{0020}only\u{0020}I\u{0020}knew\u{0020}about.", "0", "小時候在山上玩得一身土，我就會去一條只有自己知道的小溪清洗呢。", "0", "0", "0", "cv_aofeiliya_27", "0", "0"},
[403127] = {403127, 10031, 29, 21, "0", "0", "N-Navigator,\u{0020}aren't\u{0020}you\u{0020}staring\u{0020}a\u{0020}bit\u{0020}much?\u{0020}I'm\u{0020}just\u{0020}some\u{0020}village\u{0020}girl,\u{0020}there's\u{0020}nothing\u{0020}worth\u{0020}looking\u{0020}at...", "0", "領、領航是不是盯著我看得有點久了？我這種鄉下的貧瘠身體有那麼好看嗎……", "0", "0", "0", "cv_aofeiliya_28", "0", "0"},
