[403132] = {403132, 10031, 34, 26, "0", "0", "It's\u{0020}a\u{0020}fine\u{0020}day,\u{0020}Navigator.\u{0020}I\u{0020}saw\u{0020}a\u{0020}load\u{0020}of\u{0020}swallows\u{0020}just\u{0020}now.\u{0020}Even\u{0020}here\u{0020}in\u{0020}the\u{0020}city,\u{0020}they\u{0020}can\u{0020}fly\u{0020}freely\u{0020}without\u{0020}a\u{0020}care.\u{0020}It's\u{0020}wonderful.", "0", "領航，今天的天氣也很不錯呢。剛剛我看到了一群燕子，即使是在城市裡，它們也能無憂無慮地生活下去，真好啊~", "0", "0", "0", "cv_aofeiliya_33", "0", "0"},
