[413308] = {413308, 11033, 9, 5, "1_》_100_1.5", "level2", "Armor?\u{0020}That\u{0020}stuff\u{0020}is\u{0020}too\u{0020}heavy.\u{0020}If\u{0020}I\u{0020}get\u{0020}hit,\u{0020}that\u{0020}just\u{0020}means\u{0020}my\u{0020}luck\u{0020}has\u{0020}run\u{0020}out,\u{0020}and\u{0020}that's\u{0020}a\u{0020}good\u{0020}thing,\u{0020}right?", "0", "裝甲？那種東西太重了，穿在身上一點也不舒服。如果有攻擊能打中我，那就說明我的好運到頭了，也算是種好事吧。", "0", "0", "0", "cv_starry_9", "0", "0"},
[413309] = {413309, 11033, 10, 5, "1_》_500_2", "level3", "You\u{0020}still\u{0020}remember\u{0020}that?\u{0020}Sigh,\u{0020}I\u{0020}wish\u{0020}you'd\u{0020}remember\u{0020}something\u{0020}more\u{0020}important,\u{0020}like\u{0020}from\u{0020}longer\u{0020}ago...\u{0020}Oh\u{0020}well,\u{0020}pretend\u{0020}you\u{0020}didn't\u{0020}hear\u{0020}that,\u{0020}I\u{0020}said\u{0020}nothing.", "0", "你還記得那時候的事啊……唉，比起那種無聊的事，你要是能記得更久以前的事就好了……算啦，你當做沒聽見，我什麼也沒說吧。", "0", "0", "0", "cv_starry_10", "0", "0"},
[413310] = {413310, 11033, 11, 5, "1_》_1000_2.5", "level4", "By\u{0020}the\u{0020}way,\u{0020}did\u{0020}I\u{0020}ever\u{0020}tell\u{0020}you?\u{0020}I\u{0020}really\u{0020}like\u{0020}how\u{0020}Pervert-san\u{0020}doesn't\u{0020}know\u{0020}anything\u{0020}but\u{0020}still\u{0020}charges\u{0020}in\u{0020}based\u{0020}on\u{0020}instinct.\u{0020}It's\u{0020}cool.\u{0020}If\u{0020}I'm\u{0020}ever\u{0020}in\u{0020}danger,\u{0020}you\u{0020}better\u{0020}come\u{0020}and\u{0020}save\u{0020}me.", "0", "對了，我是不是沒有說過？我很喜歡雖然色狼先生那副什麼都不知道，\u{0020}但還是憑著感覺沖出來的模樣，真是酷斃了。要是有一天我遇到了危險，你也一定要來救我哦。", "0", "0", "0", "cv_starry_11", "0", "0"},
