[413313] = {413313, 11033, 14, 8, "0", "0", "Our\u{0020}greedy\u{0020}nature\u{0020}drives\u{0020}us\u{0020}to\u{0020}constantly\u{0020}seek\u{0020}better\u{0020}things,\u{0020}leaving\u{0020}no\u{0020}room\u{0020}for\u{0020}luck\u{0020}to\u{0020}spare\u{0020}us.\u{0020}Mr.\u{0020}Hentai,\u{0020}something\u{0020}bad\u{0020}might\u{0020}happen\u{0020}in\u{0020}the\u{0020}future,\u{0020}but\u{0020}this\u{0020}time,\u{0020}I'll\u{0020}face\u{0020}it\u{0020}with\u{0020}you.", "0", "我們貪婪的本性會讓我們去不斷索取更好的東西，連運氣也不會放過。色狼先生，也許以後會發生不好的事情，但這一次，我會和你共同面對的。", "0", "0", "0", "cv_starry_14", "0", "0"},
