[413513] = {413513, 11035, 14, 8, "0", "0", "My\u{0020}feelings\u{0020}are\u{0020}pretty\u{0020}mixed\u{0020}right\u{0020}now.\u{0020}If\u{0020}I'm\u{0020}this\u{0020}valued,\u{0020}I\u{0020}need\u{0020}to\u{0020}perform\u{0020}well\u{0020}on\u{0020}the\u{0020}battlefield,\u{0020}right?\u{0020}Okay,\u{0020}I've\u{0020}decided!\u{0020}I'll\u{0020}stay\u{0020}energetic\u{0020}and\u{0020}show\u{0020}you\u{0020}just\u{0020}how\u{0020}powerful\u{0020}the\u{0020}\"Demon\u{0020}of\u{0020}Solomon\"\u{0020}can\u{0020}be!\u{0020}But\u{0020}I\u{0020}can\u{0020}tell\u{0020}you\u{0020}really\u{0020}like\u{0020}me,\u{0020}heehee~♪", "0", "人家現在的心情真的有些複雜，被如此重視的話，不在戰場上好好表現是不行的吧？嗯…好！決定了，人家得拿出幹勁，讓領航你見識一下“所羅門的魔神”有多麼厲害了！……不過領航還真是喜歡人家呢，嘻嘻~♪", "0", "0", "0", "cv_zepar_11", "0", "0"},
