[413926] = {413926, 11039, 28, 21, "0", "0", "We\u{0020}agreed\u{0020}to\u{0020}meet\u{0020}up\u{0020}in\u{0020}two\u{0020}hours,\u{0020}right?\u{0020}Why\u{0020}are\u{0020}you\u{0020}here\u{0020}now?\u{0020}I...?\u{0020}Of\u{0020}course,\u{0020}I\u{0020}was\u{0020}waiting\u{0020}for\u{0020}you!", "0", "約定的時間是兩個小時之後吧？怎麼現在就來了？吾……？吾當然是在等你啦！", "0", "0", "0", "cv_sikadi_vd_28", "0", "0"},
