[421109] = {421109, 12011, 10, 5, "1_》_500_2", "level3", "Good\u{0020}morning,\u{0020}Navigator...\u{0020}Wait,\u{0020}it's\u{0020}not\u{0020}morning\u{0020}anymore?\u{0020}Oh\u{0020}well,\u{0020}it's\u{0020}just\u{0020}a\u{0020}greeting.\u{0020}As\u{0020}long\u{0020}as\u{0020}we\u{0020}understand\u{0020}each\u{0020}other,\u{0020}that's\u{0020}enough.", "0", "早安，領航…現在已經不算是早上了嗎……沒關係，那只不過是問候的形式而已，對你我而言，能明白對方的心意就已經足夠了。", "0", "0", "0", "cv_garannken_7", "0", "0"},
