[422013] = {422013, 12020, 14, 8, "0", "0", "The\u{0020}power\u{0020}on\u{0020}Earth\u{0020}is\u{0020}incredible.\u{0020}I\u{0020}bet\u{0020}not\u{0020}even\u{0020}a\u{0020}black\u{0020}hole\u{0020}could\u{0020}stop\u{0020}me\u{0020}now!\u{0020}Next\u{0020}time,\u{0020}I'm\u{0020}not\u{0020}losing\u{0020}to\u{0020}that\u{0020}big\u{0020}guy!", "0", "地球上的力量，真是不可思議啊。嗯，這樣一來，大概連黑洞的視界也抓不住我了吧！下次…遇到那個大家夥的時候，不會再輸了！", "0", "0", "0", "cv_flovilla_11", "0", "0"},
