[431410] = {431410, 13014, 11, 5, "1_》_1000_2.5", "level4", "My\u{0020}body\u{0020}is\u{0020}pretty\u{0020}cold.\u{0020}But\u{0020}are\u{0020}you\u{0020}still\u{0020}up\u{0020}for\u{0020}a\u{0020}hug?\u{0020}Oh,\u{0020}you\u{0020}are?\u{0020}You\u{0020}don't\u{0020}mind?\u{0020}I\u{0020}can\u{0020}feel\u{0020}your\u{0020}breath\u{0020}and\u{0020}warmth—it\u{0020}feels\u{0020}like\u{0020}home,\u{0020}and\u{0020}it\u{0020}puts\u{0020}me\u{0020}at\u{0020}ease...", "0", "我的身體很冷，就算這樣你還願意擁抱我嗎？是嗎，你不介意這一點嗎……感受到了…領航的氣息和體溫，仿佛像家的感覺一樣，讓我安心……", "0", "0", "0", "cv_momoca_8", "0", "0"},
