[440113] = {440113, 14001, 14, 8, "0", "0", "After\u{0020}what\u{0020}happened,\u{0020}I\u{0020}figured\u{0020}I\u{0020}was\u{0020}done\u{0020}with\u{0020}that\u{0020}idea\u{0020}of\u{0020}\"purity.\"\u{0020}It\u{0020}seemed\u{0020}as\u{0020}fragile\u{0020}as\u{0020}glass.\u{0020}Yet,\u{0020}this\u{0020}time\u{0020}spent\u{0020}with\u{0020}you\u{0020}got\u{0020}me\u{0020}thinking\u{0020}again\u{0020}about\u{0020}what\u{0020}it\u{0020}means\u{0020}to\u{0020}be\u{0020}pure\u{0020}and\u{0020}what\u{0020}truly\u{0020}lasts.", "0", "那次事件之後，我原以為我會不再堅持玻璃製品般易碎的“純粹”，但與你相處的這段時間，讓我重新開始思考何為純粹，何為永恆。", "0", "0", "0", "cv_korsgaard_14", "0", "0"},
