[4100000313] = {4100000313, 11000003, 14, 8, "0", "0", "How\u{0020}should\u{0020}I\u{0020}put\u{0020}it?\u{0020}Even\u{0020}though\u{0020}this\u{0020}is\u{0020}all\u{0020}thanks\u{0020}to\u{0020}my\u{0020}own\u{0020}hard\u{0020}work,\u{0020}I\u{0020}still\u{0020}appreciate\u{0020}having\u{0020}you\u{0020}by\u{0020}my\u{0020}side.", "0", "怎麼說呢，那個……雖然這都是人家自己努力得到的結果，但是還是多謝你一直陪著人家了。", "0", "0", "0", "cv_sk2_chilyarisa_11", "0", "0"},
