[4102800119] = {4102800119, 11028001, 14, 8, "0", "0", "Power\u{0020}can\u{0020}make\u{0020}one\u{0020}lose\u{0020}themselves,\u{0020}especially\u{0020}when\u{0020}that\u{0020}power\u{0020}surpasses\u{0020}all\u{0020}common\u{0020}sense.\u{0020}So,\u{0020}I've\u{0020}always\u{0020}been\u{0020}questioning\u{0020}my\u{0020}own\u{0020}heart,\u{0020}asking\u{0020}myself\u{0020}how\u{0020}to\u{0020}use\u{0020}this\u{0020}power.\u{0020}Navigator,\u{0020}please\u{0020}help\u{0020}me\u{0020}use\u{0020}it\u{0020}in\u{0020}the\u{0020}right\u{0020}way.\u{0020}Thank\u{0020}you.", "力を持つと人は自分自身を見失いやすくなる、その力が強ければ強いほどね。だから、私はいつも自分の心に問うの、この力の使い方を。ナビゲーター、どうか私と共に、この力を正しく使ってね。", "0", "0", "0", "0", "cv_sk_geiro_14", "0", "0"},
