[4103400113] = {4103400113, 11034001, 14, 8, "0", "0", "Hmph,\u{0020}with\u{0020}this,\u{0020}I'll\u{0020}outshine\u{0020}those\u{0020}\"geniuses,\"\u{0020}right?\u{0020}Thanks!\u{0020}Now,\u{0020}let\u{0020}me\u{0020}play\u{0020}\"Auld\u{0020}Lang\u{0020}Syne\"\u{0020}for\u{0020}you,\u{0020}Navigator...\u{0020}What?\u{0020}You\u{0020}think\u{0020}it's\u{0020}not\u{0020}fitting!?", "0", "哼哼，這樣一來，我就超過那些“天才”了吧！謝啦！之後就讓我為領航你獻上一曲“友誼地久天長”吧……誒？居然說不合適嗎！？", "0", "0", "0", "cv_sk_lodonia_11", "0", "0"},
