[4300100102] = {4300100102, 13001001, 3, 3, "0", "0", "Hello!\u{0020}I'm\u{0020}Franca\u{0020}Vinci,\u{0020}I\u{0020}just\u{0020}became\u{0020}a\u{0020}driver\u{0020}this\u{0020}year.\u{0020}It's\u{0020}a\u{0020}pleasure\u{0020}to\u{0020}meet\u{0020}you.", "0", "您好，我的名字是弗蘭卡·芬奇，是今年新上任的駕駛員，很高興能夠見到您。", "0", "0", "0", "cv_sk_furanka_1", "0", "0"},
