[4301300107] = {4301300107, 13013001, 8, 5, "15_2_0_0.8", "level2", "Did\u{0020}you\u{0020}just\u{0020}see\u{0020}a\u{0020}cat\u{0020}with\u{0020}two\u{0020}tails,\u{0020}meow?\u{0020}It\u{0020}was\u{0020}in\u{0020}the\u{0020}yard,\u{0020}but\u{0020}the\u{0020}moment\u{0020}we\u{0020}made\u{0020}eye\u{0020}contact,\u{0020}it\u{0020}disappeared\u{0020}with\u{0020}a\u{0020}\"whoosh\",\u{0020}meow.", "0", "领、领航，你刚刚有看见两只尾巴的猫咪吗喵？刚刚就在院子里散步，但是和我对上眼之后，就“嗖”得一下子不见了喵。", "0", "0", "0", "cv_sk_fururu_5", "0", "0"},
[4301300108] = {4301300108, 13013001, 9, 5, "15_1_0_0.8", "level1", "I've\u{0020}heard\u{0020}stories\u{0020}about\u{0020}kind\u{0020}cats\u{0020}in\u{0020}the\u{0020}world.\u{0020}When\u{0020}they're\u{0020}rescued\u{0020}by\u{0020}someone,\u{0020}they\u{0020}turn\u{0020}into\u{0020}a\u{0020}girl\u{0020}to\u{0020}repay\u{0020}the\u{0020}kindness,\u{0020}meow.", "0", "芙露露听说，世界上有善良的猫咪，在被人救助之后，会变成少女模样来报答恩情喵。", "0", "0", "0", "cv_sk_fururu_6", "0", "0"},
