[4105000105] = {4105000105, 11050001, 91, 4, "0", "idle", "Whoa,\u{0020}that's\u{0020}a\u{0020}lot\u{0020}of\u{0020}ice\u{0020}cream!\u{0020}I\u{0020}want\u{0020}some...\u{0020}Eh,\u{0020}it's\u{0020}a\u{0020}mountain\u{0020}of\u{0020}snow...?\u{0020}Looks\u{0020}just\u{0020}like\u{0020}ice\u{0020}cream,\u{0020}though,\u{0020}maybe\u{0020}it's\u{0020}just\u{0020}as\u{0020}sweet...", "0", "哇，好大的冰激淩，波琳娜想吃……誒，是雪山嗎？看起來和冰激淩一模一樣，說不定味道也一樣甜甜的……", "0", "0", "0", "cv_sk_borinna2_50", "0", "0,0"},
