[4105000110] = {4105000110, 11050001, 91, 4, "0", "idle1", "I\u{0020}wish\u{0020}we\u{0020}could\u{0020}play\u{0020}together\u{0020}forever,\u{0020}but\u{0020}I\u{0020}know\u{0020}you've\u{0020}got\u{0020}lots\u{0020}to\u{0020}attend\u{0020}to...\u{0020}I'm\u{0020}just\u{0020}glad\u{0020}we\u{0020}had\u{0020}the\u{0020}day\u{0020}together.", "0", "雖然好想領航一輩子都陪波琳娜玩遊戲，但是波琳娜知道領航還有很多事要忙……領航能陪波琳娜玩一天，波琳娜已經很滿足了。", "0", "0", "0", "cv_sk_borinna2_55", "0", "0,0"},
