[4101100115] = {4101100115, 11011001, 14, 8, "0", "0", "I\u{0020}will\u{0020}repay\u{0020}your\u{0020}trust\u{0020}with\u{0020}results.\u{0020}Please\u{0020}forgive\u{0020}me\u{0020}for\u{0020}only\u{0020}being\u{0020}able\u{0020}to\u{0020}say\u{0020}\"thank\u{0020}you\"\u{0020}for\u{0020}now...", "您的這份信任，我會用實績來回報的。請原諒我現在只能用一句簡單的“謝謝”來回應您……", "0", "0", "0", "0", "cv_honglei_11", "0", "0"},
