[4300600223] = {4300600223, 13006002, 14, 8, "0", "0", "Lately,\u{0020}I've\u{0020}been\u{0020}hearing\u{0020}the\u{0020}voice\u{0020}of\u{0020}the\u{0020}gods...\u{0020}No,\u{0020}that\u{0020}can't\u{0020}be.\u{0020}After\u{0020}all,\u{0020}I'm\u{0020}not\u{0020}a\u{0020}real\u{0020}shrine\u{0020}maiden.\u{0020}But\u{0020}even\u{0020}if\u{0020}I\u{0020}can't\u{0020}hear\u{0020}the\u{0020}gods,\u{0020}I\u{0020}can\u{0020}hear\u{0020}you,\u{0020}Navigator.", "0", "0", "0", "現在的我，似乎能聽見神明的聲音…那是不可能的啦。畢竟，我並不是“真正的巫女”吧。不過，雖然聽不見神靈的聲音，但我能聽見你的聲音，領航。", "0", "cv_sk1_yincao_11", "0", "0"},
